  <p style="margin:0">By accessing or using udshafts.com (the “<b>Site</b>”), creating an account, requesting a quote, or placing an order with UDS through any channel (online, by phone, by e-mail, or in person), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Use and Conditions of Sale (the “<b>Terms</b>”), our <a href="/return-policy">Return, Refund &amp; Warranty Policy</a>, our <a href="/copyright">Copyright, Trademark &amp; DMCA Notice</a>, and our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>, each of which is incorporated by reference. If you do not agree, do not use the Site or purchase from us.</p></div>

